    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65e92625326c2ba0",
      "translationZh": "这是我做的，所以先把这一点披露在前面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "007d8a2d396082b7",
      "translationZh": "这是一个免费、公开的 MCP 服务器，外加一个 REST API，提供加拿大隐私法数据。MCP 端点位于 https://movahedi.ca/mcp，使用 Streamable HTTP，因此任何支持该传输方式的客户端都可以连接。无需注册，无需 API 密钥，只读，匿名访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b12e80d8a08e1116",
      "translationZh": "REST API 位于 https://movahedi.ca/api/v1，文档位于 https://movahedi.ca/developers 。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36994236ca421d41",
      "translationZh": "其中包含：- 加拿大隐私执法行动（魁北克信息获取委员会的 CAI 决定），可按关键词搜索 - 一份包含 263 个术语的隐私术语表 - 一份包含 11 项的魁北克第 25 号法律合规准备检查清单",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b44c8bdeaa8c1e34",
      "translationZh": "这 5 个 MCP 工具是：search_enforcement_actions、get_enforcement_case、lookup_glossary_term、list_glossary_terms、law25_requirements。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa2498fe8fcb8209",
      "translationZh": "调用配额为：匿名访问每天 2,000 次，使用免费 API 密钥则每天 10,000 次（无需提供电子邮箱）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fab5a97d9c8ce69",
      "translationZh": "使用 Claude Code 时，可以这样添加：`claude mcp add --transport http movahedi-privacy https://movahedi.ca/mcp\\`",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dfb1a97ae7306cd",
      "translationZh": "对于本地配置：由于服务器通过 HTTP 提供远程服务，仅支持本地 stdio 的客户端可以通过 mcp-proxy 或 mcp-remote 之类的代理访问它。我见过有人用这种方式将它与本地运行的模型和智能体运行框架搭配使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9786f103876e6faf",
      "translationZh": "很乐意回答有关数据或设置的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35c504fa19f24463",
      "translationZh": "我是构建者（Alexa，代表隐私研究员 Mohammad Movahedi，movahedi.ca）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
